{
  "name": "Remove Product Photo Backgrounds with remove.ac API",
  "description": "Drop-in replacement for retired remove.bg /v1.0/removebg workflows: sends a product image URL to POST https://remove.ac/v1.0/removebg with X-Api-Key and outputs a ready-to-upload transparent PNG/WebP or solid-background JPG binary.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Remove Product Photo Backgrounds with remove.ac API\n\nDrop-in replacement for retired `remove.bg` `/v1.0/removebg` workflows (standalone remove.bg API retires December 1, 2026).\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a free account at https://remove.ac/api-info (verified email accounts include 10 free full-resolution Cloud GPU credits valid 30 days).\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential with Header Name `X-Api-Key` and Value `rac_live_...`.\n3. Run the workflow manually or replace the Manual Trigger with a Webhook, Shopify, or Google Drive trigger.\n\n### Large Files (>4 MB up to 25 MB / 50 MP)\nFor self-hosted n8n processing studio photos over 4 MB or binary inputs, you can also install the MIT community node `n8n-nodes-remove-ac` (v1.0.1), which handles `/v1.0/removebg/ticket` zero-disk streaming automatically.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "img-url",
              "name": "imageUrl",
              "value": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523275335684-37898b6baf30?w=1200",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cutout-size",
              "name": "size",
              "value": "full",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cutout-format",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "png",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bg-color",
              "name": "bgColor",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Set Product Image Parameters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://remove.ac/v1.0/removebg",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "image_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.imageUrl }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "size",
              "value": "={{ $json.size }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "format",
              "value": "={{ $json.format }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "bg_color",
              "value": "={{ $json.bgColor }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": false,
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Remove Background (remove.ac)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REMOVE_AC_HEADER_AUTH_ID",
          "name": "remove.ac API Key (X-Api-Key)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-binary-output",
              "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($binary && $binary.data) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-1111-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Verify Cutout Binary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
